<title>HONG KONG: China EB Tech year net loss HK$97.97 mln.</title>
<headline>China EB Tech year net loss HK$97.97 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.0 loss  vs 13.3 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  6.32 gain  vs 10.74 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    97.97 loss vs 129.96 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     467.63     vs 671.77</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Everbright Technology Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 24-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - China Everbright Technology manufactures television sets and audio products for private-label customers.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on waiver of interest payable to Everbright Holdings Ltd previously accrued and disposal of a subsidiary which held the investment in Guangdong Taishan Air-conditioner Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
